        "name": "gold",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It stores an over­\nflowing amount of\nelectric energy\finside its body.\nEven a small shock\nmakes it explode.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "silver",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The more energy it\ncharges up, the\nfaster it gets.\fBut this also\nmakes it more\nlikely to explode.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "crystal",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ELECTRODE eats electricity in the\natmosphere. On days when lightning\nstrikes, you can see this POKéMON\fexploding all over the place from\neating too much electricity.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ruby",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "One of ELECTRODE’s characteristics is\nits attraction to electricity.\nIt is a problematical POKéMON that\fcongregates mostly at electrical\npower plants to feed on electricity\nthat has just been generated.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sapphire",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "They appear in great numbers at electric\npower plants. Because they feed on\nelectricity, they cause massive and\nchaotic blackouts in nearby cities.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "emerald",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It explodes in response to even minor\nstimuli. It is feared, with the nickname\nof “The Bomb Ball.”",
      "language": {
